        <strong class="lang-en-block">3. In this week's Science &amp; Space story, how do scientists define “{issue.articles[4].terms[0].term}”?</strong>
        <strong class="lang-ko-block">3. 이번 주 과학·우주 기사에 소개된 핵심 과학 용어 ‘{issue.articles[4].terms[0].term}’는 무엇을 뜻하나요?</strong>
        <div class="quiz-options">
          <button type="button" class="quiz-opt-btn" data-correct="false">
            <span class="lang-en-inline">A) {issue.articles[1].terms[0].definition}</span>
            <span class="lang-ko-inline">A) {issue.articles[1].terms[0].definitionKo}</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="quiz-opt-btn" data-correct="false">
            <span class="lang-en-inline">B) {issue.articles[3].terms[1]?.definition ?? issue.articles[3].terms[0].definition}</span>
            <span class="lang-ko-inline">B) {issue.articles[3].terms[1]?.definitionKo ?? issue.articles[3].terms[0].definitionKo}</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="quiz-opt-btn" data-correct="true">
